// Default:        NOT_SET (( [<functionof>] ))
// Values:         EP (0), RP (1), DM (2), SW (3), NOT_SET (99)
// Parameter Type: Feature Setting
// 
// Select the Device Type of the PCIe controller. You can choose among: 
// EP: Endpoint, 
// RP: Root Port, 
// DM: Dual Mode (pin-selectable EP or RP), and 
// SW: Switch Port (pin-selectable Upstream/Downstream Switch Port). 
// This selection must be in line with your current license key.
