// Enable the optional PIPE5 behavior for the PclkChangeOk/PclkChangeAck handshake. When enabled, the controller always 
// performs a PclkChangeOk/PclkChangeAck handshake with the PHY whenever a rate change occurs, even if the new and old rate use 
// the same Pclk frequency. PHY_INTEROP_CTRL_OFF.PIPE_OPTIONAL_PCLKCHANGE_HS register uses this parameter as a reset value.
