// Values:         1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, 9, 16, 17, 32, 33, 64, 65, 96, 97, 129
// Enabled:        CC_DEVICE_TYPE!=CC_RC && CC_DEVICE_TYPE!=CC_SW
// Parameter Type: Feature Setting
// 
// Number of (physical) functions to support (in EP mode). There is a complete set of all of the 'Function/BAR 
// Configuration Parameters' parameters for each of the CX_NFUNC functions up to Physical Function 8. The additional configuration panes 
// for each additional function becomes visible when you set the CX_NFUNC configuration parameter to a value greater than 1. 
// Physical Function 9 and higher inherit the same configuration of Physical Function 8. CX_ARI_ENABLE must be 1 when you 
// have more than 8 functions.
