// Name:           VF_BAR1_RESIZABLE_1
// Default:        0x0 ((VF_BAR1_SIZING_SCHEME_1==2) ? 1 : 0)
// Values:         0x0, 0x1
// Enabled:        VF_BAR1_ENABLED_1==1
// Parameter Type: Feature Setting
// 
// Defines VF BAR1 as a resizable BAR. Setting this bit will provide 
