// Enabled:        SLAVE_POPULATED
// Parameter Type: Performance Setting
// 
// Specify the buffer size for each outbound completion, in bytes. When the AXI slave receives the read request whose 
// default value is equal to the max slave read request size, ensures that there is no performance overhead caused by the bridge. 
// Decreasing this value decreases the size of the RAM OB_CCMP_DATA_RAM proportionately, but when receiving read requests 
// whose completion exceeds this byte length, there will be throttling of request interface for one clock cycle per additional 
// segment allocation.
