// Enabled:      CX_NFUNC > 96
// 
// Specifies whether to generate EXTENDED PF DBI/WIRE View DocBook XML or HTML register reports or not for CX_NFUNC>96. 
// coreConsultant uses this parameter to determine whether to generate the extended PFs register report or not. This 
// parameter has no effect on the RTL implementation.
